  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of Tanzania PEPFAR funding is to initiate a data revolution to achieve greater transparency, mutual accountability and local impact in Sub-Saharan Africa.  The program will seek to attempt to address some of the root causes of insufficient data use for decision-making around HIV/AIDS, broader health, gender equality, and economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
